flatpak (flatpak-rs)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The native extension under ext/flatpak links flatpak, a Rust library for
reading and writing Flatpak application, module and source manifests. It is not
a binding to libflatpak. This gem is bindings for that crate and nothing else:
every class it defines wraps a type of it.

