Flatpak and flatpak-builder
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The manifest format this gem reads is Flatpak's, and flatpak-builder is the
reference for what a manifest may contain. Neither appears in any part of this
product -- they are the specification, not a dependency. Flatpak is licensed
LGPL-2.1-or-later, so no code or comment may be carried across from it into
this Apache-licensed work. Reading its documentation to learn what a field
means is fine; copying its expression is not.

